    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36cbbd14fb9116559e5002d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……仔细想想，这确实有点奇怪呢。\n我是想说如果大家都觉得这样就好的话，\n那也没有关系……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4158349ad69f6cd42d8b156ff4f4c4e9f7f3b1f1a442a93e8135954306c90a9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
