    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b34c393db5cbab0ee78d0ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但明明知道对方无法收下自己的心意，\n却依然想送对方东西，\n这到底是什么样的心态呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "408cdc76aed98ae342d2f41f4a62eee3ba62691ae1a4e80d389f8c71843fc632",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
