    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94a3b51a9a3209c07c19e02c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该不会是因为大家觉得送给我的难度比较低，\n所以想参与情人节活动的人，就选我当送礼对象？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fedb922df8561c3bcfec051cde0744f02b97194de0e99150b89f77828cc3c92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
