    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb611c1b654550e4f4985a07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过我也能理解她为何会有这样的疑问。\n明知道心意无法实现，\n却仍想送巧克力给对方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0228c7d95a9eb23aeba388bba1a2694e53765197243ba70a45351483e6be87cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
