      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb176115a8db44cbb708066",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许……是因为有重量吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "c42af55ac2e316061abbd128e38f8da4f44cca36b1d440b41e33bcb4d44db4bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70536e882f48eeb545907ceb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是因为巧克力能拿在手上，\n可以确实感受到重量。包含在巧克力里的，\n一定──都是令人心疼的小小心愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa322e1892f1749f90b4881bf3db0c68335b919febf4be8d85304dabaf9437d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:694ed6997206f588065aaf9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想多少对你造成一些影响……之类的",
      "source_fingerprint": "41300778cd388b5fea26a1e68131e7919859c165375efc494180126ad32a5ddd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
