    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53365f3d4dd8037cec83ab9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使说出口，也很快就会被她遗忘。\n她非常自由，不论是多么强烈的心意\n都无法束缚她──无法对她造成任何影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bf01ed440981d0bc0937709292e7717b379757b5cba67674fb1172c601691a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
